# Godwit dial on the Waveshare ESP32-S3-Knob-Touch-LCD-1.8: what this board
# adds to ../../sdkconfig.defaults. Read by dial-waveshare-left and
# dial-waveshare-right after it.
#
# NEVER edit `sdkconfig` directly. After changing this file, in the project
# folder:
#
#     rm sdkconfig && idf.py build
#
# The board's own options (haptics, the on-screen ring, orientation) are in
# dial_board/Kconfig with their defaults; only overrides go here.

# The enclosure holds both dials in the board's own orientation. A case that
# mounts them upside down sets CONFIG_WSKNOB_ROTATE_180=y, which turns the
# picture and the on-screen ring round.
# CONFIG_WSKNOB_ROTATE_180 is not set
